<h1 data-copy-en="Blacksmith and Forge" data-copy-zh="铁匠铺与锻造">Blacksmith and Forge</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Find Gastoff, upgrade your equipment, forge five tiers of armor pieces, and plan construction costs." data-copy-zh="找到 Gastoff，升级基础装备，打造五级护具，并查清建筑委托的条件与费用。">Find Gastoff, upgrade your equipment, forge five tiers of armor pieces, and plan construction costs.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 8 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
